---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Summer Camp Program - Marietta Childcare"
  description="Explore Marietta Childcare's Summer Camp Program with full-day activities, field trips, STEM learning, and outdoor play.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/child_swinging_playground_low_angle_background.jpg" 
        alt="Summer camp activities" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Summer Camp Program</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Full-day summer activities, field trips, STEM learning, arts and crafts, and outdoor play for engaging summers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Summer Camp Program offers full-day summer activities, field trips, STEM learning, arts and crafts, and outdoor play. The Summer Camp Program at Marietta Childcare provides engaging, educational experiences that keep children active and learning throughout the summer months.
        </p>

        <h2>Full-Day Summer Activities</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Summer Camp Program operates full-day during summer break with structured activities and free play. The Summer Camp Program includes morning activities, lunch, afternoon enrichment, and outdoor recreation.
        </p>

        <h2>Field Trips & Exploration</h2>
        <p>
          The Summer Camp Program at Marietta Childcare includes regular field trips to local attractions, parks, and educational venues. Marietta Childcare's field trips provide hands-on learning experiences and community exploration opportunities.
        </p>

        <h2>STEM Learning</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare integrates STEM (Science, Technology, Engineering, Mathematics) learning throughout the Summer Camp Program. The Summer Camp Program includes hands-on experiments, building projects, and technology activities.
        </p>

        <h2>Arts, Crafts & Creative Expression</h2>
        <p>
          The Summer Camp Program at Marietta Childcare emphasizes creative expression through art projects, music, drama, and craft activities. Marietta Childcare's creative activities support self-expression and artistic development.
        </p>

        <h2>Outdoor Play & Physical Activity</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Summer Camp Program includes daily outdoor play and physical activities. The Summer Camp Program supports physical fitness, outdoor skills, and appreciation for nature.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-primary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Summer Activities</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Field trips</li>
            <li>✓ STEM projects</li>
            <li>✓ Arts and crafts</li>
            <li>✓ Music and drama</li>
            <li>✓ Outdoor sports</li>
            <li>✓ Water activities</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-secondary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Program Details</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Full-day programs</li>
            <li>✓ Weekly themes</li>
            <li>✓ Ages 3-12</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible enrollment</li>
            <li>✓ Nutritious meals</li>
            <li>✓ Safe, supervised care</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 p-8 rounded-lg mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Make This Summer Unforgettable</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Marietta Childcare's Summer Camp Program creates memorable experiences while supporting learning and development. The Summer Camp Program keeps children engaged, active, and excited about learning.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          Enroll in Summer Camp
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Related Programs</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/programs" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">All Programs →</a>
          <a href="/solutions/summer-childcare" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Summer Childcare Solutions →</a>
          <a href="/programs/school-break-care" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">School Break Care →</a>
          <a href="/faq/hours-and-schedule" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Hours and Schedule →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
